WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:07.240
Terra is a multi-national scientific research satellite operated by NASA in a Sun-synchronous orbit around the Earth.

00:07.754 --> 00:17.882
It takes simultaneous measurements of Earth's atmosphere, land, and water to understand how Earth is changing and to identify the consequences for life on Earth.

00:18.447 --> 00:26.307
It is the flagship of the Earth Observing System (EOS) and the first satellite of the system which was followed by Aqua and Aura.

00:27.003 --> 00:29.386
Terra was launched in 1999.
